    "turn_idx": 48,
    "turn_text": "Our guest this morning, Representative Darren LeHood. Fresh from the State of the Union speech last night. Let's start with the economy. You were there when the USMCA got signed. How quickly do you think we'll see the effects of the USMCA in Illinois and your district?",
