  {
    "episode_id": 65911,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/6/5/65911.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 50,
    "turn_text": "One of the guests that the president had in the gallery last night was a young girl who wanted to go to the school of her choice and he provided her an opportunity scholarship. I know you're a big believer in private school school choice. How far do you think this can move forward? President said no parent should be forced to send their child to a failing government school. Do you think there's traction for that in the house?",
