        "text": "There is a widespread societal benefit to reintroducing vocational education at scale.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker trusts the credibility of the pledge made by the two American workers and the associated 400 companies.",
        "confidence": 0.86
      },
      {
        "text": "Public education systems should prioritize practical job readiness skills alongside academic learning.",
        "confidence": 0.85
      }
    ],
    "turn_type_label": "Substantive",
